# No environment variables are required. The app communicates directly with
# the DANDI API, and publication links (DOI, PubMed, bioRxiv, medRxiv) are
# fetched through OpenAlex and Europe PMC, which send CORS headers.
#
# Optional: a CORS proxy for the fetch_url tool and URL validation, used for
# web pages that do not send CORS headers (journal sites, GitHub, Wikipedia).
# The value is a URL template; the token {url} is replaced with the
# URL-encoded target. Leave unset to disable proxying. Examples:
#
#   VITE_CORS_PROXY_URL=https://your-worker.example.workers.dev/?{url}
#   VITE_CORS_PROXY_URL=https://api.corsproxy.io/?key=YOUR_KEY&url={url}
#
# VITE_CORS_PROXY_URL=
